Package: php8.5-fpm
Description: php8.5 container to run php-fpm (bookworm)
 By default, this image will just execute a php script located at
 /srv/app/index.php. Please note this needs to coincide with the
 path in the httpd-fcgi image.
Depends: php8.5-cli
Maintainer: SRE Service Operations <sre-service-ops@wikimedia.org>
